%% Sequence 05 — Invite organization member
%% Updated: 2026-07-27.
%% Scenario: organization owner/admin invites one user by current org workspace.
%% Evidence status: Implemented.

sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor ADMIN as Organization owner / admin
    participant B as «boundary» Browser
    participant C as «boundary» InviteMemberController
    participant K as «control» InviteUserCommand
    participant D as «entity» PostgreSQL
    participant N as «control» NotificationPublicApi

    ADMIN->>B: Enter invitee and assignable role
    activate B
    B->>C: POST /org/members/invite
    activate C
    C->>K: executeFromRequest(inviteInput)
    activate K
    K->>D: Load actor, user and current membership/invitation state
    activate D
    D-->>K: Authorization and duplicate context
    deactivate D
    alt Invite allowed
        K->>D: Create pending organization_users invitation and audit
        activate D
        D-->>K: Pending invitation
        deactivate D
        K->>N: Notify invited user
        activate N
        N-->>K: Notification persisted
        deactivate N
        K-->>C: Completed
    else Invalid role/access/duplicate
        K-->>C: Policy or conflict error
    end
    deactivate K
    C-->>B: Redirect/result
    deactivate C
    B-->>ADMIN: Show current invitations
    deactivate B
